Vendored model: MediaPipe Face Landmarker
=========================================

This directory contains a redistributed copy of Google's MediaPipe Face
Landmarker task bundle, vendored so VoiceLock can detect faces and facial
landmarks fully offline (no runtime network; loaded with
BaseOptions(model_asset_path=...)).

